                -> Index lookup on <materialized_subquery> using <auto_distinct_key> (min(a) = t2.a)
                    -> Materialize with deduplication  (rows=2)
                        -> Group aggregate: min(t1.a)  (rows=2)
                            -> Covering index scan on t1 using PRIMARY  (rows=4)

